id: MIG-025
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: advisory
title: Missing rollback/down method
category: quality
severity: warning
engine: absence
target:
  extensions: .rb
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ .git/ vendor/ node_modules/
  content_contains: def change
patterns:
  - regex: def (down|revert)
    message: "Migration without down/revert method — rollback will fail"
fix: Add a def down method that reverses the migration. Rails can auto-reverse some methods, but explicit down is safer.
